  "description": "Mozilla Firefox is an open-source web browser, designed for standards compliance, performance, and portability.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the JavaScript: GC component (CVE-2026-118007)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape due to use-after-free in the XPCOM component (CVE-2026-118021)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Graphics: Text component (CVE-2026-118024)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Race condition, use-after-free in the DOM: File component (CVE-2026-118019)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Audio/Video component (CVE-2026-124860)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Site isolation issue in the DOM: Navigation component (CVE-2026-124914)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the DOM: Core \u0026 HTML component (CVE-2026-124869)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Privilege escalation in the DOM: Navigation component (CVE-2026-124854)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Layout: Positioned component (CVE-2026-124877)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape due to use-after-free in the Widget: Gtk component (CVE-2026-124917)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Incorrect boundary conditions in the DOM: Selection component (CVE-2026-124891)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Graphics: Canvas2D component (CVE-2026-124857)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Information disclosure in the Security: RLBox component (CVE-2026-124941)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape in the DOM: Navigation component (CVE-2026-124855)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Spoofing issue in the Security component (CVE-2026-124934)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape due to incorrect boundary conditions in the Graphics: Text component (CVE-2026-124853)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape in the DOM: Navigation component (CVE-2026-124905)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape due to incorrect boundary conditions in the Storage: Cache API component (CVE-2026-124859)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the CSS Parsing and Computation component (CVE-2026-124881)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the DOM: Core \u0026 HTML component (CVE-2026-124862)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the CSS Parsing and Computation component (CVE-2026-124882)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Information disclosure in the Private Browsing component (CVE-2026-124909)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the CSS Parsing and Computation component (CVE-2026-124876)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the DOM: Workers component (CVE-2026-124893)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Graphics: WebRender component (CVE-2026-124906)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Incorrect boundary conditions in the Layout: Text and Fonts component (CVE-2026-124887)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Mitigation bypass in the WebExtensions component (CVE-2026-124910)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Privilege escalation in the Nimbus Desktop Client component (CVE-2026-124951)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Audio/Video component (CVE-2026-124865)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Incorrect boundary conditions, use-after-free in the Graphics component (CVE-2026-124948)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Undefined behavior in the WebRTC: Networking component (CVE-2026-124935)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Incorrect boundary conditions in the DOM: CSS Object Model component (CVE-2026-124875)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape due to use-after-free in the IPC component (CVE-2026-124903)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Incorrect boundary conditions in the Networking: HTTP component (CVE-2026-124856)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Networking: Cookies component (CVE-2026-124894)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Storage: localStorage \u0026 sessionStorage component (CVE-2026-124895)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Graphics: Text component (CVE-2026-124885)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Layout: Text