d Fonts component (CVE-2026-124888)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Mitigation bypass in the Add-ons Manager component (CVE-2026-124938)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape due to use-after-free in the Audio/Video: cubeb component (CVE-2026-124861)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the DOM: Editor component (CVE-2026-124898)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: JIT miscompilation in the JavaScript Engine: JIT component (CVE-2026-124939)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n",
